{"id":"torrey:weights","source":"torrey","name":"Weights","slug":"weights","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Generally regulated by the standard of the sanctuary — Ex 30:24.","refs":[["Exod",30,24,30,24]]},{"text":"Sometimes regulated by the king’s standard — 2Sa 14:26.","refs":[["2Sam",14,26,14,26]]},{"text":"Were frequently used in scales or balances — Job 31:6; Isa 40:12.","refs":[["Job",31,6,31,6],["Isa",40,12,40,12]]},{"text":"Gerah. — Ex 30:13; Eze 45:12.","refs":[["Exod",30,13,30,13],["Ezek",45,12,45,12]]},{"text":"Bekah or half shekel. — Ge 24:22.","refs":[["Gen",24,22,24,22]]},{"text":"Shekel. — Ex 30:13; Eze 45:12.","refs":[["Exod",30,13,30,13],["Ezek",45,12,45,12]]},{"text":"Dram. — Ne 7:70,71.","refs":[["Neh",7,70,7,70],["Neh",7,71,7,71]]},{"text":"Maneh or pound. — Ne 7:71; Eze 45:12.","refs":[["Neh",7,71,7,71],["Ezek",45,12,45,12]]},{"text":"Talent. — 2Sa 12:30; Re 16:21.","refs":[["2Sam",12,30,12,30],["Rev",16,21,16,21]]},{"text":"Value of money estimated according to — Ge 23:16; 43:21; Jer 32:9.","refs":[["Gen",23,16,23,16],["Gen",43,21,43,21],["Jer",32,9,32,9]]},{"text":"All metals were given by — Ex 37:24; 1Ch 28:14.","refs":[["Exod",37,24,37,24],["1Chr",28,14,28,14]]},{"text":"Provisions were sold by, in times of scarcity — Le 26:26; Eze 4:10,16.","refs":[["Lev",26,26,26,26],["Ezek",4,10,4,10],["Ezek",4,16,4,16]]},{"text":"Forbidden to have various. — De 25:13,14.","refs":[["Deut",25,13,25,13],["Deut",25,14,25,14]]},{"text":"Forbidden to have unjust. — Le 19:35,36.","refs":[["Lev",19,35,19,35],["Lev",19,36,19,36]]},{"text":"Frequently used unjust. — Mic 6:11.","refs":[["Mic",6,11,6,11]]},{"text":"Of sins. — Heb 12:1.","refs":[["Heb",12,1,12,1]]},{"text":"Of the restraints put on the elements. — Job 28:25.","refs":[["Job",28,25,28,25]]},{"text":"(Heavy,) of the exceeding glory reserved for saints. — 2Co 4:17.","refs":[["2Cor",4,17,4,17]]}],"refCount":31}
